description.content:
Retrieve detailed information about a specific Helm chart including its metadata, default values, and configuration options.

**Example Request:**
```
GET /v1/cluster/instances/kubernetes/helm/charts/name/nginx/version/15.4.0?repo_identifier=bitnami
```

**Example Response:**
```json
{
  "readme": "# NGINX Chart\n\nThis chart deploys NGINX on Kubernetes...",
  "app_readme": "# NGINX Application\n\nNGINX is a web server...",
  "questions": {
    "replicaCount": {
      "type": "integer",
      "label": "Number of replicas",
      "default": 1,
      "min": 1,
      "max": 10
    },
    "service.type": {
      "type": "enum",
      "label": "Service type",
      "options": ["ClusterIP", "NodePort", "LoadBalancer"]
    }
  },
  "values": {
    "replicaCount": 1,
    "image": {
      "repository": "bitnami/nginx",
      "tag": "1.25.3",
      "pullPolicy": "IfNotPresent"
    },
    "service": {
      "type": "ClusterIP",
      "port": 80
    }
  },
  "chart": {
    "name": "nginx",
    "version": "15.4.0",
    "app_version": "1.25.3",
    "description": "NGINX Open Source based on NGINX Alpine",
    "home": "https://github.com/bitnami/charts/tree/main/bitnami/nginx",
    "sources": ["https://github.com/bitnami/containers/tree/main/bitnami/nginx"],
    "keywords": ["nginx", "http", "web", "www", "reverse proxy"],
    "maintainers": [
      {
        "name": "VMware, Inc.",
        "url": "https://github.com/bitnami/charts"
      }
    ]
  },
  "repo_identifier": "bitnami"
}
```

**Note:** Both chart_name and chart_version are **required** parameters. repo_identifier is **optional** and defaults to the local repository.
